2026-02-10 17:57:39,430 [INFO] 파이프라인 출력: {"type": "related_article", "articles": [{"rank": 1, "title": "[춘추칼럼]쓰레기 분리수거의 날에 생각한 것들", "similarity_score": 0.5186, "url": "https://www.kyeongin.com/article/1538251", "author": "광고마케팅", "service_daytime": "2021-02-18 20:36:14", "mainthumbUrl": "https://wimg.kyeongin.com/news/legacy/thum/202102/2021021701000619800029201.jpg", "category": "일반"}, {"rank": 2, "title": "[기고] 기후위기시대, 총리가 기후정책 직접 관할해야", "similarity_score": 0.5125, "url": "https://www.kyeongin.com/article/1574040", "author": "광고마케팅", "service_daytime": "2021-12-07 20:32:04", "mainthumbUrl": "https://wimg.kyeongin.com/news/legacy/thum/202112/20211205010000582_1.jpg", "category": "일반"}, {"rank": 3, "title": "[기고] 탄소중립의 핵심 '친환경 신재생에너지'", "similarity_score": 0.501, "url": "https://www.kyeongin.com/article/1585264", "author": "광고마케팅", "service_daytime": "2022-03-20 19:30:25", "mainthumbUrl": "https://wimg.kyeongin.com/news/legacy/thum/202203/20220316010003186_1.jpg", "category": "일반"}, {"rank": 4, "title": "기후변화 대응 물관리 방향", "similarity_score": 0.4983, "url": "https://www.kyeongin.com/article/869350", "author": "광고마케팅", "service_daytime": "2014-06-19 01:02:00", "mainthumbUrl": "https://wimg.kyeongin.com/news/legacy/thum/201406/869350_430372_0248.jpg", "category": "일반"}, {"rank": 5, "title": "에너지의 날과 지구온난화", "similarity_score": 0.4957, "url": "https://www.kyeongin.com/article/344183", "author": "광고마케팅", "service_daytime": "2007-08-29 20:00:32", "mainthumbUrl": null, "category": "일반"}, {"rank": 6, "title": "[기고] 기후위기에 대응, 치수 종합대책 실현을", "similarity_score": 0.4944, "url": "https://www.kyeongin.com/article/1566354", "author": "광고마케팅", "service_daytime": "2021-09-26 21:41:28", "mainthumbUrl": "https://wimg.kyeongin.com/news/legacy/thum/202109/20210923010003814_1.jpg", "category": "일반"}, {"rank": 7, "title": "[경제전망대] 기후재앙과 공공의 책무", "similarity_score": 0.4943, "url": "https://www.kyeongin.com/article/1698848", "author": "광고마케팅", "service_daytime": "2024-07-03 20:01:33", "mainthumbUrl": "https://wimg.kyeongin.com/news/legacy/thum/202407/20240704010000428_1.jpg", "category": "일반"}, {"rank": 8, "title": "[기고]녹색전환을 위한 탄소중립 선택이 아닌 필수", "similarity_score": 0.4935, "url": "https://www.kyeongin.com/article/1541673", "author": "광고마케팅", "service_daytime": "2021-03-21 20:10:26", "mainthumbUrl": "https://wimg.kyeongin.com/news/legacy/thum/202103/2021031501000630300031421.jpg", "category": "일반"}, {"rank": 9, "title": "기후위기는 가난한 사람에 더 가혹… 정의로운 전환 '풀뿌리 운동' 대안", "similarity_score": 0.4907, "url": "https://www.kyeongin.com/article/1645972", "author": "김명래", "service_daytime": "2023-07-09 20:00:37", "mainthumbUrl": "https://wimg.kyeongin.com/news/legacy/thum/202307/2023070901000309100014981.jpg", "category": "일반"}, {"rank": 10, "title": "우리의 작은실천이 지구를 살린다", "similarity_score": 0.486, "url": "https://www.kyeongin.com/article/348310", "author": "광고마케팅", "service_daytime": "2007-10-03 01:00:07", "mainthumbUrl": null, "category": "일반"}, {"rank": 11, "title": "[기고] 기후위기 시대 대응을 위한 조기 조치", "similarity_score": 0.4851, "url": "https://www.kyeongin.com/article/1585780", "author": "광고마케팅", "service_daytime": "2022-03-21 20:01:40", "mainthumbUrl": "https://wimg.kyeongin.com/news/legacy/thum/202203/20220321010004033_1.jpg", "category": "일반"}, {"rank": 12, "title": "이재명 대표, 정부에 '기후에너지부' 신설 제안", "similarity_score": 0.4839, "url": "https://www.kyeongin.com/article/1663218", "author": "오수진", "service_daytime": "2023-11-08 10:23:02", "mainthumbUrl": "https://wimg.kyeongin.com/news/legacy/thum/202311/2023110801000345100016481.jpg", "category": "일반"}, {"rank": 13, "title": "[이재우 칼럼] 기후 위기와 인류 멸절의 위기", "similarity_score": 0.4836, "url": "https://www.kyeongin.com/article/1610658", "author": "광고마케팅", "service_daytime": "2022-10-10 19:16:00", "mainthumbUrl": "https://wimg.kyeongin.com/news/legacy/thum/202210/20221010010000523_1.jpg", "category": "일반"}, {"rank": 14, "title": "대재앙의 서막", "similarity_score": 0.4826, "url": "https://www.kyeongin.com/article/317426", "author": "광고마케팅",